    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** QT Imaging’s core radiation-free breast imaging business is ramping sharply, with scanner deployments hitting record levels and a growing installed base. The concurrent introduction of the QTI Cloud Platform layers on SaaS and AI-based biomarker analytics, shifting the model toward recurring, high-margin revenue. An affirmed ambitious revenue outlook for the coming year and initial international contracts point to strong underlying demand for radiation-free imaging solutions.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership has engineered a notable turnaround, relisting the company on Nasdaq, resolving legacy warrant liabilities, and delivering a full-year operational performance that exceeded its own sales targets. The strategic pivot from a pure scanner manufacturer to a precision imaging and biomarker-driven franchise is being well-received, and management’s confident forward guidance signals growing execution credibility with the market.",
